WEBVTT

00:01.626 --> 00:04.421
Is that all, Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer?

00:04.504 --> 00:06.256
You tried so hard to escape.

00:06.339 --> 00:08.383
But you should be
reaching your limits, right?

00:13.972 --> 00:15.890
Unfortunately…

00:17.767 --> 00:18.727
What's this?

00:19.477 --> 00:21.771
His cursed energy is rising.

00:22.522 --> 00:26.151
I'll start working overtime.

00:27.986 --> 00:29.612
Overtime?

00:30.447 --> 00:32.115
Time-related constraints?

00:32.615 --> 00:36.036
Was he limiting his cursed energy?

00:37.120 --> 00:38.538
This is interesting!

00:40.957 --> 00:44.836
My cursed technique
is to force the seven to three ratio

00:44.919 --> 00:49.924
into weakness when dividing
the enemy into equal parts.

00:50.800 --> 00:54.929
Not only the height and limbs
can be divided equally,

00:55.513 --> 00:58.558
but I can also use it on the head, body,

00:58.641 --> 01:02.604
upper arm, forearm, and so on.

01:03.730 --> 01:08.693
And my cursed technique
works on non-creatures as well.

01:10.278 --> 01:12.155
Is he disclosing his cursed technique?

01:12.906 --> 01:13.948
I guess you're serious.

01:16.785 --> 01:19.037
-The methods to kill this Curse Spirit…
-Playing…

01:19.120 --> 01:21.915
-that I can think of now is…
-tag again?

01:22.499 --> 01:26.878
One, continue to inflict damage
until it runs out of cursed energy.

01:26.961 --> 01:29.339
But it's unrealistic.

01:29.881 --> 01:31.174
Another way…

01:31.257 --> 01:34.636
is to blow it into pieces in one blow!

01:35.762 --> 01:37.931
Ratio Technique, Collapse!

01:39.808 --> 01:41.351
What amazing power.

01:41.434 --> 01:42.393
No, wait a minute.

01:42.477 --> 01:45.063
His cursed energy dissipated.
Could it be that…

01:46.397 --> 01:50.068
It's an expanded cursed technique that
injects cursed energy into his target!

01:50.151 --> 01:52.904
It's an attack that hits both of us.

01:52.987 --> 01:54.739
I guess I should…

01:55.990 --> 01:57.575
…evade it.

02:00.912 --> 02:03.039
I'll retreat temporarily.

02:03.790 --> 02:06.501
You better fix your leg
as soon as possible.

02:07.043 --> 02:10.797
Let's meet again if we both stay alive.

02:13.299 --> 02:14.259
What?

03:51.231 --> 03:53.858
That's strange.
Did the earth shake for a while just now?

03:53.942 --> 03:56.903
Yes, it felt like
a magnitude two earthquake.

04:00.823 --> 04:02.909
No good. Mr. Ijichi isn't picking up.

04:04.285 --> 04:07.121
-Can I ask him already?
-What?

04:07.205 --> 04:11.042
Actually, is it a good idea
to be honest with him?

04:11.125 --> 04:14.837
Speaking of which, how much can I
explain about Jujutsu High School?

04:16.673 --> 04:19.300
The number you have dialed
cannot be reached at the moment.

04:19.384 --> 04:20.551
Answer it!

04:23.846 --> 04:24.931
Wait!

04:25.014 --> 04:28.059
What should I do?

04:29.269 --> 04:30.937
A vortex button?

04:31.562 --> 04:32.647
That's right.

04:32.730 --> 04:36.109
If you meet a student
with a vortex button,

04:36.192 --> 04:37.694
you should be nice to them.

04:38.278 --> 04:40.196
They are Jujutsu Sorcerers.

04:40.280 --> 04:42.240
You'll get along with them.

04:43.825 --> 04:47.620
But Jujutsu Sorcerers
are Mahito's enemies, right?

04:49.122 --> 04:50.999
Forget it! I'll just ask!

04:51.582 --> 04:55.044
Hey, someone died in the cinema
you went to before.

04:55.878 --> 04:57.297
Did you see anything?

04:57.380 --> 04:59.299
Like this gross thing, for example.

04:59.966 --> 05:01.926
No, I didn't see it.

05:02.010 --> 05:05.722
I only started to
see these things recently.

05:06.222 --> 05:07.515
I see.

05:08.016 --> 05:09.851
All right, I have nothing else to ask.

05:09.934 --> 05:11.019
That quick?

05:11.978 --> 05:15.148
But you still have to wait
for someone who's like my boss.

05:15.231 --> 05:16.274
Is that fine?

05:16.357 --> 05:17.525
Okay.

05:19.777 --> 05:20.611
Hey.

05:20.695 --> 05:22.655
What did you watch in the cinema?

05:22.739 --> 05:26.409
It's a rereleased old movie.
You wouldn't know.

05:26.492 --> 05:28.244
Just tell me.

05:29.162 --> 05:30.955
The Human Centipede 3.

05:31.039 --> 05:32.623
That one is so boring!

05:32.707 --> 05:35.501
I got beaten several times
because of that.

05:35.585 --> 05:37.336
Beaten?

05:37.420 --> 05:39.297
Gosh.

05:39.797 --> 05:41.841
But it's a violent movie.

05:41.924 --> 05:45.845
Maybe we shouldn't ask for
anything other than a bloody scene.

05:45.928 --> 05:49.515
-But the second installation--
-The second installation was interesting!

05:50.892 --> 05:52.643
Yes, that's right!

05:52.727 --> 05:55.188
Only the second installation is enjoyable.

05:55.271 --> 05:57.356
-Enjoy?
-Jackpot.

05:57.440 --> 06:00.151
Have you seen the whole series?

06:01.194 --> 06:06.616
The second movie looks the same
as the first and third movies,

06:06.699 --> 06:10.870
but it gives a detailed
emotional description on

06:10.953 --> 06:13.039
how a perfectionist gives up on himself.

06:13.706 --> 06:14.791
Mother.

06:15.750 --> 06:18.169
No wonder the second movie was good!

06:18.252 --> 06:19.462
Why?

06:20.213 --> 06:23.216
I didn't understand
why it was interesting at first,

06:23.299 --> 06:25.051
so I watched it three times.

06:25.134 --> 06:27.220
The second movie
was the most gruesome too,

06:27.303 --> 06:28.888
so it was hard for me.

06:29.639 --> 06:31.224
Why would you go that far?

06:32.683 --> 06:34.811
Do you like movies, Itadori?

06:34.894 --> 06:38.356
I've been watching it lately
for some reason,

06:38.856 --> 06:41.484
but I didn't watch it in a cinema.

06:41.567 --> 06:42.527
I see.

06:42.610 --> 06:46.405
But when you watch interesting films
in a cinema, it feels really touching.

06:46.489 --> 06:48.658
Although video on demand
is more convenient.

06:48.741 --> 06:51.244
When was the last time I went there?

06:51.869 --> 06:54.413
If you have a movie suggestion,
bring me along next time.

06:54.497 --> 06:55.790
What?

06:55.873 --> 06:57.291
Do you want my contact number?

06:57.959 --> 06:59.085
Here.

07:00.962 --> 07:04.006
How do I add friends on this again?

07:04.090 --> 07:05.800
What? Is that you, Junpei?

07:06.467 --> 07:07.885
Mother!

07:07.969 --> 07:11.389
It's rare to find you here.
Is he your friend?

07:11.472 --> 07:13.266
I just met him.

07:13.349 --> 07:17.270
We just met, but we can be friends!

07:17.353 --> 07:20.440
Really? Please play with him more.

07:21.482 --> 07:23.025
-Mother!
-What?

07:23.109 --> 07:24.444
Cigarettes.

07:26.154 --> 07:27.780
Didn't I tell you not to smoke?

07:29.073 --> 07:30.366
I'm sorry.

07:30.450 --> 07:33.202
We agreed not to smoke in front of you.

07:34.829 --> 07:36.581
What's your friend's name?

07:36.664 --> 07:38.166
I'm Yuji Itadori!

07:38.249 --> 07:40.460
Ma'am, the green onions don't suit you.

07:40.543 --> 07:41.878
Wow, you can tell?

07:41.961 --> 07:44.589
My goal is to become a woman
who doesn't suit green onions.

07:44.672 --> 07:46.340
What are you saying?

07:46.424 --> 07:47.675
How about it, Yuji?

07:47.758 --> 07:49.218
Want to come over for dinner?

07:49.302 --> 07:51.304
Hey! You're causing trouble for him!

07:51.387 --> 07:53.806
What? Is it troublesome to eat my cooking?

07:53.890 --> 07:55.057
ZOOMING

07:55.558 --> 07:57.894
GROWLING

07:58.811 --> 08:01.272
Is there anything you don't like?
What about allergies?

08:01.355 --> 08:02.231
None at all!

08:13.159 --> 08:13.993
What?

08:20.791 --> 08:24.545
Unlike his appearance,
he's really reckless!

08:24.629 --> 08:27.924
-You had a great fight.
-Geto!

08:28.007 --> 08:31.344
That guy was interesting.
I've learned a lot.

08:31.427 --> 08:32.553
Is that so?

08:32.637 --> 08:37.767
Even if I'm crushed, I won't die
if I maintain the shape of my soul.

08:37.850 --> 08:41.521
Consuming cursed energy
is also a type of self-sufficiency.

08:42.021 --> 08:47.068
And no matter how I change my soul,
there's no risk at all.

08:47.151 --> 08:49.946
I'll try something bolder next time.

08:50.029 --> 08:52.198
Geto, give me clothes.

08:52.281 --> 08:53.658
No.

08:53.741 --> 08:55.952
Where's the Jujutsu Sorcerer
who fought with you?

08:56.035 --> 08:59.205
I have no idea.
He said he's going to retreat for a while.

08:59.288 --> 09:00.831
Maybe he's still under the rubble.

09:02.166 --> 09:03.000
What?

09:03.084 --> 09:05.002
You're going to Junpei Yoshino's house?

09:05.086 --> 09:07.588
-That's…
-It's okay.

09:08.089 --> 09:10.967
-I'm going to have dinner.
-Dinner?

09:11.050 --> 09:12.927
I'll come right away.

09:13.010 --> 09:15.972
If something feels wrong,
please get out of there.

09:17.181 --> 09:22.019
Even if Junpei Yoshino
was the perpetrator of this incident,

09:22.103 --> 09:26.190
the current Itadori
won't be killed so easily.

09:27.066 --> 09:31.153
But this is my negligence
as his supervisor.

09:31.237 --> 09:33.489
Let's not talk about
the carefree Mr. Gojo.

09:33.573 --> 09:36.492
If I get scolded by Mr. Kento,
the most mature man ever,

09:37.326 --> 09:39.453
I might cry.

09:39.537 --> 09:41.038
Let's hurry up!

09:41.122 --> 09:44.166
I don't want to cry in front of others
at this age!

09:46.335 --> 09:47.670
CALLING
KENTO NANAMI

09:47.753 --> 09:49.839
He called earlier than I expected!

09:49.922 --> 09:51.257
I'm going to get scolded!

09:51.966 --> 09:53.092
Yes, I'm sorry.

09:53.175 --> 09:54.218
What?

09:54.802 --> 09:58.639
I sent you my location just now,
please pick me up.

09:58.723 --> 10:02.935
I'll go back to Jujutsu High School
and find Ms. Ieiri for treatment.

10:03.019 --> 10:04.770
Treatment?

10:04.854 --> 10:08.149
I'm okay. It's not fatal.

10:08.232 --> 10:09.942
That's great.

10:10.026 --> 10:13.446
I'll meet up with Itadori first
and find you after.

10:13.946 --> 10:15.781
Aren't you together?

10:16.574 --> 10:18.659
I'm such a fool.

10:24.498 --> 10:26.751
I practiced it many times.

10:28.127 --> 10:30.129
Your body is perfect for experimentation.

10:30.880 --> 10:32.506
I'm so lucky.

10:35.843 --> 10:38.054
That Cursed Spirit is just a kid.

10:38.971 --> 10:42.642
It probably hasn't been long
since he manifested.

10:42.725 --> 10:45.936
He grew up greedily and enjoyed it.

10:46.896 --> 10:49.523
The Special Grade Cursed Spirit
that fought with Mr. Gojo

10:49.607 --> 10:52.652
has learned Domain Expansion.

10:52.735 --> 10:55.446
If that Cursed Spirit is still alive,

10:55.529 --> 10:58.282
it won't take long
for him to be this strong.

10:58.949 --> 11:02.536
Furthermore, the number of victims
is far beyond our expectations.

11:03.120 --> 11:05.331
Help me.

11:06.123 --> 11:08.542
We must exorcise him as soon as possible.

11:09.126 --> 11:12.129
Before it's too late.

11:17.802 --> 11:18.844
And then?

11:18.928 --> 11:22.056
And then Takashi said this confidently.

11:22.139 --> 11:24.683
This is an alien larva!

11:24.767 --> 11:26.060
It might be poisonous.

11:26.143 --> 11:27.728
Don't touch it, everyone!

11:27.812 --> 11:29.814
And when I picked it up,

11:29.897 --> 11:32.608
it was just the konjac strip
from our lunch!

11:34.110 --> 11:36.779
Did you hear that? It's a konjac strip!

11:36.862 --> 11:39.698
-Mother, you drank too much.
-Itadori, you're hilarious!

11:39.782 --> 11:42.326
Here, make a joke with this.

11:42.410 --> 11:44.453
This drunkard is horrible.

11:45.121 --> 11:47.164
Wilson!

11:47.248 --> 11:51.335
-Forgive me, Wilson!
-That's from Cast Away, right?

11:51.419 --> 11:52.837
Correct!

11:52.920 --> 11:54.255
I don't understand.

11:54.338 --> 11:55.548
Is it a movie joke?

11:55.631 --> 11:58.008
It's fire!

12:08.519 --> 12:11.439
Your mother is a good person.

12:12.982 --> 12:14.066
She is.

12:16.235 --> 12:17.403
School?

12:20.406 --> 12:23.659
-Isn't it fine? Just don't go.
-What?

12:23.742 --> 12:28.122
Boys your age tend to overthink things.

12:28.205 --> 12:31.709
The school is just a small aquarium.

12:33.377 --> 12:36.714
There are seas and other larger aquariums.

12:36.797 --> 12:38.132
Choose what you like.

12:38.215 --> 12:41.635
I say some nice things!

12:41.719 --> 12:44.889
That's a great quote!
As expected of myself!

12:50.060 --> 12:52.646
What kind of person is your mom?

12:52.730 --> 12:53.814
Well…

12:53.898 --> 12:55.441
I've never seen her before,

12:55.524 --> 12:58.402
and I have a vague memory about my father.

12:59.153 --> 13:01.155
But I do have a grandfather.

13:03.949 --> 13:05.743
Sorry, I got a call.

13:06.243 --> 13:07.912
Hello, Mr. Ijichi?

13:08.746 --> 13:10.498
Yes, I'm okay.

13:12.333 --> 13:14.710
We're going to watch a movie.

13:15.252 --> 13:16.462
Yes.

13:16.545 --> 13:18.964
-I'll see you in two hours.
-Two hours--

13:20.216 --> 13:23.010
You're a Jujutsu Sorcerer, right, Itadori?

13:23.093 --> 13:24.053
Yes.

13:24.136 --> 13:26.597
Should I have said that?

13:27.306 --> 13:30.476
-Have you ever killed anyone?
-What?

13:31.560 --> 13:32.686
No.

13:33.646 --> 13:37.733
But you'll need to fight
with other bad Jujutsu Sorcerers.

13:37.816 --> 13:39.860
What will you do then?

13:40.778 --> 13:43.739
Even so, I don't want to kill anyone.

13:43.822 --> 13:46.492
Why not? They are bad people.

13:47.076 --> 13:48.285
How should I put it?

13:48.369 --> 13:50.120
If I kill once,

13:50.204 --> 13:54.500
the option of killing
will appear in my life.

13:54.583 --> 13:57.211
The value of life becomes ambiguous.

13:57.294 --> 14:00.339
I won't understand the value
of someone important to me.

14:01.590 --> 14:02.883
I'm scared of that.

14:07.054 --> 14:09.014
"A human has no heart."

14:09.598 --> 14:11.767
I was saved by this idea.

14:12.518 --> 14:15.020
He gave me strength.

14:15.729 --> 14:21.902
However, if the soul is stained
because I killed someone…

14:25.698 --> 14:27.074
I can't…

14:27.157 --> 14:28.742
kill anyone.

14:35.791 --> 14:37.835
Gosh, I fell asleep.

14:37.918 --> 14:40.462
Has Yuji gone back?

14:40.546 --> 14:43.632
Oh, no, it's already so late!
I need to clean up.

14:43.716 --> 14:45.509
What?

14:45.593 --> 14:47.177
What's this?

14:49.722 --> 14:50.973
A finger?

14:59.857 --> 15:02.401
After the incident
at Satozakura High School,

15:02.484 --> 15:07.281
Junpei Yoshino found her mother,
Nagi Yoshino's body,

15:07.364 --> 15:10.784
and Sukuna's left pinky finger at home.

15:11.452 --> 15:13.871
It was believed that Nagi Yoshino
was attacked by

15:13.954 --> 15:16.415
a Cursed Spirit
that was attracted to the finger.

15:16.999 --> 15:19.919
Part of her lower body was missing.

15:20.502 --> 15:23.881
No bloodstains were found at the scene.

15:24.590 --> 15:28.302
Nagi Yoshino's body was found
lying in the bedroom.

15:28.886 --> 15:31.513
When the blanket was taken off,

15:31.597 --> 15:34.683
there were refrigerants
and ice packs all over the body.

15:36.352 --> 15:38.938
Do you think I'll hold you back, Nanami?

15:39.021 --> 15:42.608
You got hurt! Bring me along next time.

15:43.776 --> 15:47.446
"My comrade died, but I wasn't there."

15:47.529 --> 15:50.616
"Because I'm still a kid."
How can I say that?

15:53.744 --> 15:56.330
You're strong enough to save others.

15:57.414 --> 15:59.792
I don't want to say that.

15:59.875 --> 16:01.126
No.

16:01.627 --> 16:06.757
As you know, that stitched-face
Cursed Spirit uses transfigured humans.

16:07.800 --> 16:11.053
There are hopeless people in the world.

16:11.804 --> 16:13.847
As long as you're doing this job,

16:13.931 --> 16:17.518
you'll encounter someone
that must be killed someday.

16:18.352 --> 16:20.729
But now's not the time.

16:20.813 --> 16:23.524
Even so, I don't want to kill anyone.

16:23.607 --> 16:25.317
I'm scared of that.

16:27.236 --> 16:28.988
Please understand.

16:29.071 --> 16:32.616
Being a child is never a sin.

16:33.158 --> 16:37.329
Please keep an eye on Junpei Yoshino.

16:41.291 --> 16:46.088
I don't have black clothes,
so I opened my mother's wardrobe

16:46.171 --> 16:49.216
and grabbed the first
black pair of clothes I could find.

16:50.968 --> 16:52.970
I breathed in the familiar morning air,

16:53.971 --> 16:55.848
and took the usual path to school.

16:56.890 --> 16:57.850
Today…

16:59.351 --> 17:02.354
This is Sukuna.

17:02.438 --> 17:04.565
It's a cursed object that attracts curses.

17:04.648 --> 17:07.568
Why did this thing appear at my house?

17:07.651 --> 17:11.238
There are many Curse Users
who earn money by cursing people.

17:11.321 --> 17:13.574
I guess they did it.

17:13.657 --> 17:18.454
You can kill someone with a curse
as long as you have the way and money.

17:18.537 --> 17:20.581
Does someone come to mind?

17:20.664 --> 17:23.459
A person that hates you and your mother.

17:24.334 --> 17:30.257
Or a shady person who's rich and free.

17:31.050 --> 17:32.426
Certificate of Recommendation.

17:33.010 --> 17:37.347
The top prize in the National Book Report
Competition goes to…

17:37.431 --> 17:39.308
Shota Ito.

17:40.225 --> 17:41.351
-One, two.
-One, two.

17:41.435 --> 17:44.021
-Shota!
-Shota!

17:46.356 --> 17:48.942
This is making me embarrassed.

17:51.570 --> 17:54.198
I'm glad that our student…

17:54.281 --> 17:56.909
-can receive such an honorable award.
-What are you doing?

17:56.992 --> 18:01.330
Didn't I tell you to write casually?
It even won the best award.

18:01.413 --> 18:03.332
-I hope everyone can develop…
-Want to die?

18:03.415 --> 18:05.292
I'm sorry.

18:05.375 --> 18:08.337
And you're only shortlisted.

18:09.588 --> 18:12.216
Shota is really cool.

18:12.299 --> 18:14.384
-Right?
-Really?

18:14.468 --> 18:16.929
It's not bad that he's a rich kid.

18:17.012 --> 18:18.013
What?

18:18.097 --> 18:20.015
What's that black thing?

18:20.099 --> 18:21.850
What? Where?

18:24.812 --> 18:27.689
"Emerge from darkness,
that which is darker than black."

18:27.773 --> 18:30.526
"Purify this impurity."

18:36.573 --> 18:38.867
It's a success.

18:38.951 --> 18:40.536
I'm sorry, Mahito.

18:40.619 --> 18:43.580
I can't leave any residuals behind.

18:44.081 --> 18:45.499
What's the use of Veil?

18:46.917 --> 18:50.212
It prevents anyone
within the area from leaving.

18:50.295 --> 18:53.382
But it's limited to humans
with weak cursed energy.

18:53.465 --> 18:56.677
It's an unannounced Veil
that appears in the residential area.

18:57.177 --> 18:59.721
The windows will report it soon.

19:00.222 --> 19:03.267
I hope the situation you wish for
comes true.

19:04.017 --> 19:06.103
It should work out.

19:07.062 --> 19:10.607
The moment Junpei met Sukuna's vessel,

19:10.691 --> 19:12.568
luck was already on our side.

19:13.569 --> 19:15.154
Let them fight.

19:15.237 --> 19:17.406
Then I'll force Yuji Itadori
into a Binding Vow,

19:17.489 --> 19:20.075
which will assert
Sukuna's superiority over him.

19:20.159 --> 19:23.579
If only Jogo was as levelheaded as you…

19:23.662 --> 19:26.331
His straightforward personality
is quite cute.

19:26.415 --> 19:27.916
In any case, is it really okay?

19:28.000 --> 19:30.836
Isn't the finger precious?

19:31.420 --> 19:32.421
It's okay.

19:32.504 --> 19:37.050
The finger in the detention center
was quickly absorbed by Yuji Itadori.

19:37.134 --> 19:41.722
I want Jujutsu High School to take
the one left in Junpei Yoshino's house.

19:41.805 --> 19:43.265
Really?

19:43.348 --> 19:44.474
Is that a conspiracy?

19:44.558 --> 19:45.726
I guess you can say that.

19:46.560 --> 19:48.604
Well then, I'll get going.

19:48.687 --> 19:49.563
What?

19:49.646 --> 19:50.814
You're leaving?

19:50.898 --> 19:52.816
You should watch too, Geto.

19:53.317 --> 19:55.027
It will definitely be fun…

19:56.862 --> 19:59.823
watching the demise of foolish children.

20:01.783 --> 20:03.035
Hey!

20:03.118 --> 20:04.203
What's wrong, everyone?

20:04.286 --> 20:06.663
Pull yourself together. Are you okay?

20:07.789 --> 20:09.333
They won't die.

20:09.416 --> 20:10.500
What?

20:11.501 --> 20:12.628
Yoshino?

20:13.128 --> 20:14.421
Why?

20:14.504 --> 20:15.380
No.

20:15.464 --> 20:18.842
Do you know what's happening?

20:19.343 --> 20:23.305
Take a closer look, Mr. Sotomura.

20:24.473 --> 20:26.516
You… Those scars…

20:27.768 --> 20:28.977
That's…

20:29.061 --> 20:31.063
The things that have happened so far

20:31.146 --> 20:33.357
and the things that will happen…

20:33.941 --> 20:35.359
Yoshino…

20:37.736 --> 20:39.780
I have something to ask you.

20:39.863 --> 20:43.784
Did you put that thing in my house?

20:43.867 --> 20:46.328
What are you talking about--

20:50.457 --> 20:52.709
What's going on?

20:52.793 --> 20:54.211
What did you do?

20:55.128 --> 20:57.172
This isn't getting anywhere.

20:58.674 --> 21:03.679
Do you think you can answer
questions with questions?

21:03.762 --> 21:06.390
You're going to die

21:06.473 --> 21:09.518
regardless of your answer!

21:09.601 --> 21:12.896
Because I can't tell if you're lying.

21:12.980 --> 21:16.441
Besides, you're guilty for
what you've done to me!

21:17.609 --> 21:20.654
Let me see your sincerity
at your last moment.

21:21.363 --> 21:24.324
I'm sorry…

21:25.200 --> 21:26.285
And then?

21:29.329 --> 21:30.497
So?

21:33.542 --> 21:34.418
What?

21:39.506 --> 21:42.592
What are you doing, Junpei?

21:45.679 --> 21:48.432
Step aside, Jujutsu Sorcerer.

23:21.441 --> 23:24.277
The floor plan's good,
but a three-burner stove portends death.

23:24.361 --> 23:27.030
Burn, Mount Hiei!
Matsutake for aroma! Shimeji for flavor!

23:27.114 --> 23:30.117
Signs of autumn are disappearing
along with your loved ones' tears!

23:30.200 --> 23:32.119
Next time,
episode 12 of Jujutsu Kaisen!

23:32.202 --> 23:34.121
"Bloodshed Autumn Leaf-viewing."

23:34.204 --> 23:35.872
What's being hunted is your heart.
